{"bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapter":{"bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","chapterSlug":"ch01","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionCount":43,"questions":[{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0001","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":1,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-01.webp","x":197,"y":434,"width":1023,"height":204,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":628,"width":1160,"height":67,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"企業籌措資金之管道可分為「直接金融」與「間接金融」兩種,下列何者是屬於「直接金融」?甲、發行新股;乙、發行轉換公司債;丙、向銀行借款;丁、辦理私募","optionTexts":{"1":"甲、丙、丁","2":"甲、乙、丁","3":"乙、丙、丁","4":"甲、乙、丙"},"explanationText":"向金融機構借款係屬於間接融資。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"a585c20aaa225012658e8dcb9327acda4df578e44d515dbc77575ce800564de2","explanationSegmentsSha256":"a97ff7a3836ed562a8faf67b6df8c751ae96cd25f9c13b8636baaba658c5eab0"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0002","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":2,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-01.webp","x":192,"y":685,"width":1028,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":788,"width":1160,"height":114,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"在一般證券市場中所稱之為「發行市場」者,其另一種稱謂為","optionTexts":{"1":"流通市場","2":"初級市場","3":"交易市場","4":"次級市場"},"explanationText":"發行市場一般又稱之為初級市場,流通市場則稱之為次級市場。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"1a0e61630e3004f5c0da1e6af1b7045b8931f07c89324efe6469775260d510ec","explanationSegmentsSha256":"1d5420b16a1684b886489d7ad631188fceb1e744fcb68872fcccf6dec34ef667"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0003","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":3,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-01.webp","x":192,"y":892,"width":1028,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":995,"width":1160,"height":297,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"貨幣市場與資本市場之信用工具期限之分界點,係為","optionTexts":{"1":"3個月","2":"1年","3":"3 年","4":"10 年"},"explanationText":"貨幣市場與資本市場係依據資金融通時間的長短為標準劃分,貨幣市場係指短期貸款或以短期證券作為交易之市場,其期限通常在一年以內之工商週轉資金,拆款及各種短期票券皆為其主要對象。資本市場則係指長期信用工具交易的市場,包括政府發行之長期債券、公司債、股票及抵押貸款,其交易的信用工具期限均在一年以上。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"dd39712dc585edbe8d953d05e949ac2c4d68993bb4c749a6f9e30cf41ea0ae9e","explanationSegmentsSha256":"350aa8193171d6a7c1796e43dc9705d2cc2b4068d4e145c0be156df883587397"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0004","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":4,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-01.webp","x":191,"y":1282,"width":1029,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1384,"width":1160,"height":156,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"將資金透過金融機構再由金融機構提供給企業之資金運用方式,稱為","optionTexts":{"1":"消費金融","2":"企業金融","3":"間接金融","4":"直接金融"},"explanationText":"所謂間接金融,意指金融中介機構透過向資金供給者取得資金,貸放給資金的需求者,由於融通之過程係透過金融機構介入於資金供給者或資金需求者間,因此稱為「間接金融」。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"baa0b00caa3aa1bbd74be5d8aff8e5a3aecb87e66940c287448086625c4e6563","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b03819970fd854f8173ad111bd6c0d7bba0ada92357c42cbad1323b58f0ea5ef"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0005","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":5,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-01.webp","x":197,"y":1530,"width":1023,"height":126,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1646,"width":1160,"height":42,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":204,"width":1160,"height":119,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者非我國貨幣市場流通之主要信用工具？","optionTexts":{"1":"國庫券","2":"上市公司股票","3":"銀行承兌匯票","4":"商業本票"},"explanationText":"我國目前在貨幣市場流通之信用工具主要有：國庫券、商業本票、銀行承兌匯票及可轉讓定期存單等。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"53e7fb8dc095f3d5eab5e8f13b84c606b6765111ee8aac39a485da4d4fe38387","explanationSegmentsSha256":"c4519d7bebcf0fa6fd002366f134e2ffe1dc75d77c444d097a215dcb61fff7ef"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0006","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":6,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":197,"y":313,"width":1023,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":415,"width":1160,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"企業向投資大眾籌措資金之處所為","optionTexts":{"1":"交易市場","2":"銀行","3":"發行市場","4":"臺灣證券交易所"},"explanationText":"證券市場之範圍可區分為發行市場與交易市場,發行市場又稱初級市場,係指發行人為籌措中長期資金以發行證券方式,向資金供給者之投資大眾募集資金之場所。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"43c5067a65f1fffeccd991b5ecbe460564c16336b43bc2084e6f9a537d1f5587","explanationSegmentsSha256":"bff0022ffeda918c10df9827dc19d31724da52828a61bdc8655a10063404f324"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0007","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":7,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":199,"y":562,"width":1021,"height":203,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":755,"width":1160,"height":68,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"國內證券市場中所稱之三大法人係指下列何者?甲、壽險公司乙、證券投資信託公司所經理之證券投資信託基金丙、外資法人丁、證券自營商戊、勞退基金","optionTexts":{"1":"甲、乙、丙","2":"甲、丙、戊","3":"乙、丙、丁","4":"丙、丁、戊"},"explanationText":"三大法人係指外資、證券投信所經理之基金及自營商。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"18f201738bb61516b4aca54b446756856134820f68e14c1df58ed27918364199","explanationSegmentsSha256":"697f2de9a8b73c9beb0a87aa38e64da98c97a336040ebe26b5970435995274a5"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0008","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":8,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":200,"y":813,"width":1020,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":916,"width":1160,"height":110,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者非為企業募集資金之市場?","optionTexts":{"1":"拆款市場","2":"股票市場","3":"債券市場","4":"票券市場"},"explanationText":"拆款市場為金融同業的資金借貸之市場,也就是參加銀行同業拆款中心之會員,可以向其他會員拆人或拆出資金。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"1f7be35ec09f8fae2b40b322e50fa74d294d86d27aab513049def169b7c09212","explanationSegmentsSha256":"aa81b10ad52cd68b8e263d6c294dd180db53a96f760d0a4b7cf4ad9911ad496b"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0009","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":9,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":198,"y":1016,"width":1022,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1118,"width":1160,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"國庫券屬於以下哪一類金融商品?","optionTexts":{"1":"貨幣市場","2":"期貨市場","3":"資本市場","4":"債券市場"},"explanationText":"國庫券係政府為調節國庫收支或為穩定金融市場而發行的短期政府票券,屬貨幣市場之商品。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"271e82ac1364c99993309756b6d244206a3ba195e2a79738149e2ff61188a3c7","explanationSegmentsSha256":"f70b8455b2de38fe654360813c3fe24b6b66452702a49a85f56097308f9026a0"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0010","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":10,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":191,"y":1221,"width":1029,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1323,"width":1160,"height":64,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列標的在櫃檯買賣市場交易,何者採競價方式?","optionTexts":{"1":"興櫃股票","2":"上櫃股票","3":"轉換公司債","4":"黃金現貨交易平臺"},"explanationText":"興櫃股票、轉換公司債及黃金現貨交易平臺採議價方式交易。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"c2c033a006c5280aa169c37a80f0c3b2ada8deafd9644f6995b4757e3064349f","explanationSegmentsSha256":"e7a2f5ef6cad6b9037c09315d7a6373e1d4d296d1f799d12e001d8b7783fb6f5"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0011","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":11,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":192,"y":1377,"width":1028,"height":153,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1520,"width":1160,"height":138,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":213,"width":1160,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以下何者符合二因子認證之設計?","optionTexts":{"1":"僅提供密碼及出生月日","2":"僅提供身分證及健保卡","3":"僅提供指紋及人臉辨識","4":"僅提供身分證號碼及聲紋辨識"},"explanationText":"「二因子認證(two-factor authentication)」設計或進行,係指利用知識要素(what you know,例如密碼)、擁有要素(what you have,例如身分證)及本質要素(what you are,例如指紋)取其二的方式構成,例如運用金融卡加上密碼即為二因子驗證。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"038c7ce9fc9f92da5e18f2a5d0d553c8764e77d174a011f090c0b8bbd698101b","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b47baf7bc08638f0b555c89e8c5a15ec1262b36d258f08f72b5943406e98115c"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0012","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":12,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-03.webp","x":157,"y":318,"width":1063,"height":153,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":461,"width":1160,"height":151,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"幾個常見的網路攻擊手法中,藉由在同一時間內送出大量封包,衝爆網站造成當機並停止服務的為","optionTexts":{"1":"釣魚","2":"蠕蟲","3":"SQL資料隱碼攻擊","4":"分散式阻斷服務攻擊"},"explanationText":"分散式阻斷服務攻擊(Distributed Denial of Service Attack, DDoS Attack)亦稱洪水攻擊,藉由在同一時間內送出大量封包,衝爆網站造成當機並停止服務。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"1f2fcb24ea74068dfeecb74d73ba0d821535961e26edd71b1d5f05e8487db899","explanationSegmentsSha256":"609ad908f1934dcb0dce24672a02e7f26014026b6ca0ee37d2110b7051288930"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0013","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":13,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-03.webp","x":157,"y":602,"width":1063,"height":152,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":744,"width":1160,"height":151,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"哪一個階段洗錢者會透過各種方式隱匿非法資金來源,像是透過全球各個離岸金融中心,讓資金變的難易追溯?","optionTexts":{"1":"分層化階段","2":"流入階段","3":"初始階段","4":"整合階段"},"explanationText":"第二階段,分層化階段(Layering Stage),洗錢者透過各種方式隱匿非法資金來源,像是透過全球各個離岸金融中心,也可能藉由購買投資工具,讓資金便的難易追溯。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"0ed227b0ac6aded4e390317fba599abca2f969a3b0f1b75d4e5588171562f01c","explanationSegmentsSha256":"556d77e18cd5b4f35607390557218d2068145c602e08653cf16b6a191fe8afad"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0014","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":14,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-03.webp","x":156,"y":885,"width":1064,"height":377,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1252,"width":1160,"height":436,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":206,"width":1160,"height":250,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"依據「證券商提供數位服務作業指引」,「數位體驗專區」之定義為何?","optionTexts":{"1":"證券商透過科技及網路,以數位體驗專區及客戶服務中心形式,提供客戶之金融服務","2":"設置符合資通安全標準之數位介面設備,提供非特定人使用或體驗與證券商經營證券業務相關服務之營業處所,並得配置服務人員提供諮詢服務、進行商品介紹及推廣","3":"證券商透過網路智能客服、電話、電子郵件、書信或採用其他新興科技等方式,對客戶被動提供諮詢、證券業務活動推廣及商品說明服務,暨處理消費爭議與建言之營業處所","4":"以上皆非"},"explanationText":"依「證券商提供數位服務作業指引」§2之用詞定義: 一、數位服務:本指引所稱之數位服務係指證券商透過科技及網路, 以數位體驗專區及客戶服務中心形式,提供客戶之金融服務。二、數位體驗專區:係指設置符合資通安全標準之數位介面設備,提供非特定人使用或體驗與證券商經營證券業務相關服務之營業處所,並得配置服務人員提供諮詢服務、進行商品介紹及推廣。三、客戶服務中心:係指證券商透過網路智能客服、電話、電子郵件、書信或採用其他新興科技等方式,對客戶被動提供諮詢、證券業務活動推廣及商品說明服務,暨處理消費爭議與建言之營業處所。四、權責單位:與證券交易所訂立有價證券集中交易市場使用契約者,權責單位為證券交易所;僅與櫃檯買賣中心訂立證券商經營櫃檯買賣有價證券契約者,權責單位為櫃檯買賣中心。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"0add9c07fb4dcd07d53c7ad195ce9be9bcfd7d24fbccc1329bc7f799b11da05c","explanationSegmentsSha256":"385b6f51117c798599fb76be856d26df8c1b84cd9e482d381fb95171ae6eeb4c"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0015","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":15,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-04.webp","x":172,"y":446,"width":1048,"height":155,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":591,"width":1160,"height":68,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商設置「數位體驗專區」或「客戶服務中心」,要向下列哪單位提出申請?甲.金融監督管理委員會乙.證券交易所丙.櫃檯買賣中心","optionTexts":{"1":"僅甲","2":"僅乙","3":"僅丙","4":"乙或丙"},"explanationText":"依「證券商提供數位服務作業指引」§2之用詞定義: 一、數位服務:本指引所稱之數位服務係指證券商透過科技及網路, 以數位體驗專區及客戶服務中心形式,提供客戶之金融服務。二、數位體驗專區:係指設置符合資通安全標準之數位介面設備,提供非特定人使用或體驗與證券商經營證券業務相關服務之營業處所,並得配置服務人員提供諮詢服務、進行商品介紹及推廣。三、客戶服務中心:係指證券商透過網路智能客服、電話、電子郵件、書信或採用其他新興科技等方式,對客戶被動提供諮詢、證券業務活動推廣及商品說明服務,暨處理消費爭議與建言之營業處所。四、權責單位:與證券交易所訂立有價證券集中交易市場使用契約者,權責單位為證券交易所;僅與櫃檯買賣中心訂立證券商經營櫃檯買賣有價證券契約者,權責單位為櫃檯買賣中心。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"3ef4d74af42f4fbc936d7a995fdbf876440f9bb13e436972a486d7963c93c440","explanationSegmentsSha256":"e35a54b760e8511412283dac3ca8c01e3889f6ff8c0acb4a0c4da985aa16cfcc"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0016","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":16,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-04.webp","x":171,"y":649,"width":1049,"height":246,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":885,"width":1160,"height":695,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者非證券商設置「數位體驗專區」需符合之條件?","optionTexts":{"1":"須設置在總公司或分支機構營業處所內","2":"須與專供辦理受託買賣證券之營業櫃檯及專門受理非當面委託之交易室有明顯區隔","3":"設置之數位介面設備須提供網路下單之功能","4":"配置於數位體驗專區之業務人員,須於證券商申報單一窗口登記為數位服務職務"},"explanationText":"依「證券商提供數位服務作業指引」§3規定,二、設置標準: (一)場地:限於總公司、分支機構或簡易分支機構營業處所內設置, 須與專供辦理受託買賣證券之營業櫃檯及專門受理非當面委託之交易室有明顯區隔。(二)設備: 1.得設置適量之數位介面設備,但不得提供網路下單之功能。2.證券商應就設備提供之服務,評估資通安全、個人資料風險, 並訂定控管措施。3.資通安全機制應符合證券商內部控制制度標準規範。(三)人員資格 1.證券商得配置適足之業務人員,或由總公司、分支機構或簡易分支機構具業務員資格者兼任。2.配置於數位體驗專區之業務人員須於證券商申報單一窗口登記為數位服務職務,且兼任與兼辦職務行為應符合證券商負責人與業務人員管理規則之規定。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"d25a1f469ad8ac63e6031bb01c7bf325bb79fd4dda71678e65dcaf18a015ed54","explanationSegmentsSha256":"c3a80aef1b4081921c14209bb422ed3fe24198e869c4eeb5a5a40f82b1d62d14"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0017","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":17,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-04.webp","x":170,"y":1570,"width":1050,"height":94,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-05.webp","x":170,"y":215,"width":1050,"height":111,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":316,"width":1160,"height":291,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者非證券商「數位體驗專區」可提供之服務範圍?","optionTexts":{"1":"教導客戶運用數位工具","2":"提供客戶諮詢服務、金融商品相關活動訊息","3":"進行商品介紹與推廣","4":"代理客戶操作數位工具"},"explanationText":"依「證券商提供數位服務作業指引」§3規定,三、服務範圍: (一)教導客戶運用數位工具,包含開戶作業、委託買賣系統操作及帳務作業。(二)提供客戶諮詢服務、金融商品相關活動訊息及進行商品介紹與推廣。(三)不得受託買賣有價證券及代理客戶操作數位工具。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"775070e56bfba98c28917bb97346b8e5afe1078bf8ac9ccd64ad07e78a84c4f0","explanationSegmentsSha256":"593f9da25b1a1aa45bdfa759afa15900964a13200d925b27d7d7a343a8871786"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0018","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":18,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-05.webp","x":183,"y":597,"width":1037,"height":245,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":832,"width":1160,"height":745,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"有關證券商設置或變動「數位體驗專區」,以下敘述何者錯誤?","optionTexts":{"1":"須特別為「數位體驗專區」申請擴增營業處所","2":"啟用前須向權責單位申報啟用日期","3":"設置之申請文件包括個人資料風險及控管措施","4":"設置後當擴增、縮減或裁撤數位體驗專區,均須向權責單位申報備查"},"explanationText":"依「證券商提供數位服務作業指引」§3規定,四、設置或變動申請作業程序: (一)證券商應檢具下列申請文件,並載明設置地點,向權責單位申請核准;如因設置數位體驗專區須擴增營業處所,涉及變更營業處所地址者,則須併同辦理換發證券商許可證照作業: 1. 提供服務範圍說明。2.人員名冊及資格證明文件。3.場地平面圖及照片。4.設備符合標準之說明、資通安全風險評估文件及控管措施,應包含設備內容、技術規格、所採用之新興科技(例如雲端運算服務、物聯網設備、生物辨識、行動式設備等),暨證券商就相關設備及技術評估之資通安全、個人資料風險及控管措施。(二)證券商應於數位體驗專區啟用前,向權責單位申報啟用日期。(三)數位體驗專區之擴增及縮減,應於使用前檢附場地平面圖及照片,向權責單位申報備查;裁撤前,應檢具裁撤原因向權責單位申報備查。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"287b5de801eb129a062b0ed42184c53e879bb09c40c1fabee04361e15ade2527","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b764a85d2e89284c8f3d7bbf1966b2a05d0bd81f76a4287d6fa11e82925c3364"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0019","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":19,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-05.webp","x":185,"y":1567,"width":1035,"height":119,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-06.webp","x":185,"y":200,"width":1035,"height":203,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":393,"width":1160,"height":659,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者非證券商設置「客戶服務中心」需符合之條件?","optionTexts":{"1":"一定須設置在總公司或分支機構營業處所內","2":"須與營業處所有明顯區隔","3":"證券商應就「客戶服務中心」設備提供之服務,評估資通安全、個人資料風險,並訂定控管措施","4":"配置於客戶服務中心之業務人員,須於證券商申報單一窗口登記為數位服務職務"},"explanationText":"依「證券商提供數位服務作業指引」§4:二、設置標準: (一)場地:不限於總公司、分支機構或簡易分支機構所在縣市設置, 但不得作為對外接洽客戶親臨之場所;若於總公司、分支機構或簡易分支機構內設置,應與營業處所有明顯區隔。(二)設備: 1.證券商應就設備提供之服務,評估資通安全、個人資料風險, 並訂定控管措施。2.資通安全機制應符合證券商內部控制制度標準規範。(三)人員資格: 1.證券商得配置適足之業務人員,或由總公司、分支機構或簡易分支機構熟悉證券相關法令及作業流程之人員兼任。2.配置於客戶服務中心之業務人員須於證券商申報單一窗口登記為數位服務職務,且兼任與兼辦職務行為應符合證券商負責人與業務人員管理規則之規定。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"e39b556a96ad2e5a1e1cb46744978fbeb971cc6124b315850705fddd48088034","explanationSegmentsSha256":"d035fb274389ac6cc84bd0ee82f937a89ba381e6b32fdc12776481235314cbf5"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0020","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":20,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-06.webp","x":171,"y":1042,"width":1049,"height":156,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":1188,"width":1160,"height":287,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者非證券商「客戶服務中心」可提供之服務範圍?","optionTexts":{"1":"提供客戶諮詢服務","2":"處理客戶消費爭議","3":"主動向客戶推介金融商品","4":"被動提供客戶交易平臺說明"},"explanationText":"依「證券商提供數位服務作業指引」§4規定,三、服務範圍: (一)提供客戶諮詢服務、處理客戶消費爭議及建言。(二)被動提供客戶金融商品說明、交易平臺說明、證券業務相關活動及市場訊息等業務。(三)不得對客戶投資組合提供任何建議等涉及推介之行為、不得接受客戶委託買賣有價證券、不得接受客戶親臨申辦或洽談業務。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"b4573f8812c878eae27c4293bd844f4a21bf8e921fc4b15b9e0bd50f1919313d","explanationSegmentsSha256":"e5566d619d3392e99fbeaf8a72578447232e31db0e5a1e13f46dacc9f35c55ae"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0021","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":21,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-06.webp","x":173,"y":1465,"width":1047,"height":184,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":147,"width":1160,"height":133,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以下何者為證券商「客戶服務中心」可提供之服務範圍?","optionTexts":{"1":"主動提供客戶證券業務相關活動及市場訊息","2":"對客戶詢問之金融商品回覆說明","3":"接受客戶委託買賣有價證券","4":"可接受客戶親臨申辦或"},"explanationText":"依「證券商提供數位服務作業指引」第4條，數位服務得提供客戶諮詢、處理消費爭議與建言，並被動提供金融商品、交易平臺、證券業務活動及市場訊息；不得提供投資組合建議、接受客戶委託買賣有價證券，亦不得接受客戶親臨申辦或洽談業務。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"659cfd6537e1ff7f02a8ca18aa43ea21e111d945de0ef35353e2e684738e47a0","explanationSegmentsSha256":"bae2d575e7565f908d1b93b444cb06335573b4a1bb71d4fccf6752171b67b458"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0022","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":22,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-07.webp","x":162,"y":270,"width":1058,"height":259,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":519,"width":1160,"height":72,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以下哪些為證券商「客戶服務中心」可提供之服務範圍?甲.處理客戶消費爭議乙.對客戶詢問之金融商品回覆說明丙.對客戶詢問之交易平臺操作功能回覆說明丁.對客戶詢問其投資組合建議,提供投資產品推介","optionTexts":{"1":"僅甲","2":"僅甲、乙","3":"僅甲、乙、丙","4":"甲、乙、丙、丁皆是"},"explanationText":"依「證券商提供數位服務作業指引」§4規定,三、服務範圍: (一)提供客戶諮詢服務、處理客戶消費爭議及建言。(二)被動提供客戶金融商品說明、交易平臺說明、證券業務相關活動及市場訊息等業務。(三)不得對客戶投資組合提供任何建議等涉及推介之行為、不得接受客戶委託買賣有價證券、不得接受客戶親臨申辦或洽談業務。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"201de313e272a3a554092656dd063cf19fa8186beeb2f5058c36ae9494571bec","explanationSegmentsSha256":"098fb3f17a8b7f60b7a09a3607c7ca9a57dbdef6992ed88da251e9610d6eb7ca"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0023","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":23,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-07.webp","x":161,"y":581,"width":1059,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":686,"width":1160,"height":210,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商「客戶服務中心」與客戶間溝通過程應至少保留幾年?","optionTexts":{"1":"一年","2":"三年","3":"五年","4":"十年"},"explanationText":"依「證券商提供數位服務作業指引」§4規定,五、記錄保存及服務聲明之控管措施:(一)證券商與客戶間溝通過程(包含電話錄音、與智能客服對話紀錄等)應至少保存一年,但有爭議或申訴者, 應保留至該爭議消除或申訴結案為止。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"b0bb4d9531a6b95712d0eeba30aa7f08cbc25c92b057d8f4f841c75541ee9018","explanationSegmentsSha256":"f53ba325eae36e967e80c2178d1804489546e5e68ff29278a3cc90bb66d9afc4"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0024","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":24,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-07.webp","x":162,"y":886,"width":1058,"height":208,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":1084,"width":1160,"height":71,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"對於證券商「客戶服務中心」與客戶間溝通過程紀錄保存規範,以下敘述何者錯誤?","optionTexts":{"1":"所有紀錄均至少須保存一年","2":"服務人員以電話提供服務須進行電話錄音","3":"以智能客服提供服務亦須保留紀錄","4":"有爭議或申訴之案件應保留紀錄五年"},"explanationText":"依「證券商提供數位服務作業指引」§4規定,五、記錄保存及服務聲明之控管措施:(一)證券商與客戶間溝通過程(包含電話錄音、與智能客服對話紀錄等)應至少保存一年,但有爭議或申訴者, 應保留至該爭議消除或申訴結案為止。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"750598a8617c5358799483b91d2e164419b35c0fe7fe619104108007708ac776","explanationSegmentsSha256":"2d5f9c52d3f55c8ecb5c6e2e226b9a77c65f1fc0b038880eae26f111096e47ed"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0025","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":25,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-07.webp","x":162,"y":1145,"width":1058,"height":206,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":1341,"width":1160,"height":347,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":197,"width":1160,"height":298,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商為客戶線上開戶,其作業除應確定其身分為本人及留存相關證明文件外,應先經下列何方式確認身分?","optionTexts":{"1":"洽往來交割銀行確認","2":"以自然人憑證、銀行帳戶或晶片金融卡辦理線上身分驗證","3":"經由視訊影像方式確認","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)任一皆可"},"explanationText":"依證交所及櫃買中心「證券商受理線上開戶委託人身分認證及額度分級管理標準」§2第1項規定,證券商就線上開戶程序,應於內部控制制度自行訂定相關作業流程。受理該類開戶作業除應確定其身分為本人及留存相關證明文件外,應先經下列任一方式確認身分: 一、洽往來交割銀行確認。二、以自然人憑證、銀行帳戶或晶片金融卡辦理線上身分驗證。三、經線上傳送可同時辨識國民身分證及臉部之照片,並輔以證券商交割專戶客戶分戶帳指定出金帳戶。四、經由視訊影像方式確認。五、經由行動身分識別(Mobile ID)方式確認,相關身分認證應遵循事項由本公司另訂之。六、經由金融行動身分識別標準化機制(金融Fast-ID)確認,相關身分驗證機制應遵循「金融機構辦理快速身分識別機制安全控管作業指引」辦理。七、透過其他可確認身分之方式。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"3e96c28db87342b8187b58c39437b6381ac70c51c76957ce0939f3a6ca426c40","explanationSegmentsSha256":"618edac903cfe817095100227c9de53accccb84b34aa24a74c2f5669962cf54c"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0026","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":26,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-08.webp","x":158,"y":485,"width":1062,"height":290,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":765,"width":1160,"height":64,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商為客戶線上開戶,其作業除應確定其身分為本人及留存相關證明文件外,應先經下列何方式確認身分?","optionTexts":{"1":"經線上傳送可同時辨識國民身分證及臉部之照片,並輔以證券商交割專戶客戶分戶帳指定出金帳戶","2":"經由行動身分識別(Mobile ID)方式確認","3":"經由金融行動身分識別標準化機制(金融Fast-ID)確認","4":"選項(1)(2)(3) 任一皆可"},"explanationText":"依證交所及櫃買中心「證券商受理線上開戶委託人身分認證及額度分級管理標準」§2第1項規定,證券商就線上開戶程序,應於內部控制制度自行訂定相關作業流程。受理該類開戶作業除應確定其身分為本人及留存相關證明文件外,應先經下列任一方式確認身分: 一、洽往來交割銀行確認。二、以自然人憑證、銀行帳戶或晶片金融卡辦理線上身分驗證。三、經線上傳送可同時辨識國民身分證及臉部之照片,並輔以證券商交割專戶客戶分戶帳指定出金帳戶。四、經由視訊影像方式確認。五、經由行動身分識別(Mobile ID)方式確認,相關身分認證應遵循事項由本公司另訂之。六、經由金融行動身分識別標準化機制(金融Fast-ID)確認,相關身分驗證機制應遵循「金融機構辦理快速身分識別機制安全控管作業指引」辦理。七、透過其他可確認身分之方式。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"a033973d24e4d6eb5b42df40020b66ba0e5207f80a18039f6f6996a45c8aed1d","explanationSegmentsSha256":"701016a59f31ae4a43c3db7a226423e0a529fec2ebd7f8f18e550bf20e5119c7"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0027","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":27,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-08.webp","x":157,"y":819,"width":1063,"height":199,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":1008,"width":1160,"height":200,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商為客戶線上開戶作業,經確定其身分為本人及留存相關證明文件外,且依規定確認身分後,尚須輔以下列何種方式強化驗證?","optionTexts":{"1":"以手機簡訊傳送一次性安全密碼(OTP)","2":"由專人電訪","3":"選項 (1)或(2)任一即可","4":"選項(1)和(2)皆同時為必須"},"explanationText":"依證交所及櫃買中心「證券商受理線上開戶委託人身分認證及額度分級管理標準」§2第2項規定,以前項方式確認身分者,證券商應輔以手機簡訊傳送一次性安全密碼(One Time Password-OTP)或由專人電訪等方式強化驗證。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"b973451aea21a82294fd75c028ac1695d307a7623dabb7f15827828fdeb449da","explanationSegmentsSha256":"e648ff1bb40b8d17eebcc95a7da6147e915e44bfc50b07a49b04e6e50484a8b0"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0028","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":28,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-08.webp","x":156,"y":1198,"width":1064,"height":331,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":1519,"width":1160,"height":136,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":146,"width":1160,"height":267,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商經取得委託人同意後,由委託人透過載有4G以上門號SIM 卡之行動裝置,經第三方認證機構向委託人所屬之電信業者,以委託人之行動電話號碼、國民身分證統一編號及生日,與電信業者之行動門號租用人申辦資料進行比對,確認為一致後通知證券商,這種線上開戶的身分認證作業稱為","optionTexts":{"1":"行動身分識別(Mobile ID)","2":"金融行動身分識別標準化機制(金融Fast-ID)","3":"以自然人憑證辦理線上身分驗證","4":"以晶片金融卡辦理線上身分驗證"},"explanationText":"依證交所及櫃買中心「證券商辦理行動身分識別(Mobile ID) 身分認證應遵循事項」§2第1項規定,行動身分識別(Mobile ID),係指證券商經取得委託人同意後,由委託人透過載有4G以上門號SIM 卡之行動裝置,經第三方認證機構向委託人所屬之電信業者,以委託人之行動電話號碼、國民身分證統一編號及生日,與電信業者之行動門號租用人申辦資料進行比對,確認為一致後通知證券商,所進行之身分認證作業。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"6e9420c93c88d5013a60b7a3d7a5666dd6c5635ac2d0b75264fda4d953c8191f","explanationSegmentsSha256":"3483cb2f5811f59c44971e8f9b718c9b24cf6fc04e7495e3ea7bd8d3578e69af"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0029","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":29,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-09.webp","x":158,"y":403,"width":1062,"height":305,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":698,"width":1160,"height":494,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"委託人進行線上開戶時,透過行動身分識別(Mobile ID)驗證所需滿足之條件,以下何者錯誤?","optionTexts":{"1":"須透過載有3G以上門號SIM卡之行動裝置","2":"委託人已閱讀並同意行動身分識別服務使用者約定條款","3":"委託人已閱讀並同意隱私權告知條款","4":"委託人已通過行動身分識別(Mobile ID)身分認證、閱讀並同意受託契約條款、個人資料蒐集、處理及利用聲明與風險預告書"},"explanationText":"承上題,須透過載有4G以上門號SIM卡之行動裝置。另依證交所及櫃買中心「證券商辦理行動身分識別(Mobile ID)身分認證應遵循事項」§3第1項規定,證券商於辦理本業務,除應遵循證券商內部控制制度標準規範、個人資料保護法、防制洗錢及打擊資恐之相關規範,並應訂定包括但不限於下列作業處理程序及風險控管措施,相關控制機制應留存檢核紀錄:二、確保委託人已閱讀並同意行動身分識別服務使用者約定條款及隱私權告知條款後,方能進行行動身分識別。三、確保委託人已通過行動身分識別(Mobile ID)身分認證、閱讀並同意受託契約條款、個人資料蒐集、處理及利用聲明與風險預告書,並上傳國民身分證件之影像檔及填寫個人基本資料。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"12de0e9fa47649925d02e420ae810469309a1a9cb4ff66555b7e0ddd79069d34","explanationSegmentsSha256":"835bb0e004c3284d6ac7c98ab3493201358e98308e391912e4e614adf371d0e6"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0030","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":30,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-09.webp","x":154,"y":1182,"width":1066,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":1285,"width":1160,"height":261,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商辦理行動身分識別(Mobile ID),最少隔多久應定期查核檢討?","optionTexts":{"1":"3 個月","2":"半年","3":"1年","4":"3 年"},"explanationText":"依證交所及櫃買中心「證券商辦理行動身分識別(Mobile ID) 身分認證應遵循事項」§6規定,證券商辦理行動身分識別(Mobile ID),至少應每半年定期查核檢討,如有接獲委託人表示所簽署之開戶契約非本人真意所為者或發生交易糾紛案件,應擬具改善計畫並提報董事會。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"e5e36282e9f5c0ea364f327b2d368211673faa579209d0d53f5f3326e1835105","explanationSegmentsSha256":"722c68477026ea19a33872af8f2b8f12fb16daf995e740624a013b3404699936"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0031","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":31,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-09.webp","x":156,"y":1536,"width":1064,"height":152,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-10.webp","x":156,"y":210,"width":1064,"height":153,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-10.webp","x":60,"y":353,"width":1160,"height":426,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"某人在證券商線上開戶,經行動身分識別(Mobile ID)方式及一次性安全密碼(OTP)完成身分認證程序,某人未另外提供資力證明,且帳戶未約定於委託買賣時採預收或圈存方式辦理,此人帳戶單日買賣最高額度原則以新臺幣多少元為限?","optionTexts":{"1":"10萬","2":"50萬","3":"100萬","4":"500 萬"},"explanationText":"依證交所及櫃買中心「證券商受理線上開戶委託人身分認證及額度分級管理標準」§3第2~4項規定,第一類帳戶單日買賣最高額度原則以新臺幣100萬元為限。第二類帳戶應以自然人憑證或銀行帳戶辦理線上身分驗證,輔以視訊影像確認身分。第二類帳戶經檢具委託人資力證明,得不受前項額度限制,由證券商確實按公會自律規則自行評估單日買賣最高額度。第三類帳戶應約定於委託買賣時採預收或圈存方式,餘有關評估單日買賣最高額度之方式,比照第二類帳戶辦理。本題某人明顯未符合第二類帳戶或第三類帳戶要求,故採第一類帳戶單日買賣最高額度原則以新臺幣100萬元為限。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"cc4ed97419348273efe7b88ebb4b2b15ce5e66ccdce02fda0b8e85cc8b600408","explanationSegmentsSha256":"3889e3fd2df13b7a6636d629ad134daa1c48d397831fcd80cfa8b9681f90a233"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0032","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":32,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-10.webp","x":184,"y":769,"width":1036,"height":107,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-10.webp","x":60,"y":866,"width":1160,"height":154,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"網際網路下單證券商應至少多久進行一次資訊安全風險評鑑?","optionTexts":{"1":"半年","2":"一年","3":"兩年","4":"三年"},"explanationText":"依「建立證券商資通安全檢查機制」§1規定,風險評鑑與管理(CC-11000,年度查核):(3)公司應至少每年進行一次資訊安全風險評鑑,並留存相關紀錄。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"b5695704d061c47828273990a6efbfefd4ac78a3f149716383de06707bcaa5ac","explanationSegmentsSha256":"0e32f7680ad1edacbf1290d063951a38a6a5611526e4b1b2e0d567ec3da7c1a7"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0033","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":33,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-10.webp","x":184,"y":1010,"width":1036,"height":153,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-10.webp","x":60,"y":1153,"width":1160,"height":242,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商可接受以下何種有價證券之申購、買賣或交割?","optionTexts":{"1":"非本人之委託","2":"未具客戶委任書之代理人委託","3":"投顧由電腦系統自動為客戶執行自動再平衡交易","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆不得接受委託"},"explanationText":"依「證券商管理規則」§37規定,證券商經營證券業務,除法令另有規定外,不得有下列行為:十三、受理非本人或未具客戶委任書之代理人申購、買賣或交割有價證券。但證券商依其與客戶及證券投資顧問事業共同簽訂之三方契約,接受證券投資顧問事業由電腦系統自動為客戶執行自動再平衡交易者,不在此限。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"4077655ed8810b6c2cc31483c3c1a032a9c0138491b1c43340e88f206106e5c1","explanationSegmentsSha256":"1cafa67a717fe4f26c4283eda26716ec41851340f14e9f46219e9ddd31a10700"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0034","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":34,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-10.webp","x":185,"y":1385,"width":1035,"height":109,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-10.webp","x":60,"y":1484,"width":1160,"height":170,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"新設置之證券商,開始營業屆滿多久方得申請設置簡易分支機構?","optionTexts":{"1":"無限制","2":"滿半年","3":"滿一年","4":"滿三年"},"explanationText":"依「證券商設置標準」§19規定,依本標準許可設置之證券商,開始營業屆滿一年者得申請設置分支機構或簡易分支機構。但因合併或受讓而設置分支機構或簡易分支機構者,不在此限。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"13b16caa457b71a5d9d6f8ed4339e1f3e638d59dbab3e9508821da4911e9c255","explanationSegmentsSha256":"faa74da9cddd76c636f32cf10bf35307d0990afb461a8eb9533f9a2c8ce1e183"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0035","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":35,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-11.webp","x":166,"y":150,"width":1054,"height":111,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-11.webp","x":60,"y":251,"width":1160,"height":266,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商申請分支機構變更為簡易分支機構,自有資本適足比率至少需要達到多少以上?","optionTexts":{"1":"無限制","2":"100%","3":"150%","4":"200%"},"explanationText":"依「證券商設置標準」§20-1第1項規定,證券商申請分支機構變更為簡易分支機構,應符合前條第一項第六款及第七款規定。依 §20第1項規定證券商申請設置分支機構或簡易分支機構,應符合下列各款之規定:七、證券商自有資本適足比率未低於百分之一百五十者。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"4798bffff2a554c548ad2bb9e9972920bbb6c74a851274ccc904ef3e5f8ec570","explanationSegmentsSha256":"502b9705c4a3b8b8c47580383e3c2ff49f4b519fd9a412a666ae1a00d89ea0e8"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0036","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":36,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-11.webp","x":161,"y":507,"width":1059,"height":164,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-11.webp","x":60,"y":661,"width":1160,"height":166,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商每多設置一家簡易分支機構,其最低實收資本額應增加多少?","optionTexts":{"1":"免增加","2":"新臺幣五百萬元","3":"新臺幣一千萬元","4":"新臺幣三千萬元"},"explanationText":"依「證券商設置標準」§21規定,證券商每設置一家分支機構或簡易分支機構,其最低實收資本額,應增加新臺幣三千萬元。但證券商分支機構變更為簡易分支機構,免增加最低實收資本額。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"ea123bb3b5fdffe24afbe47246df1d9414fee2041e56ea8600c40ee8aa561ea6","explanationSegmentsSha256":"3dfae985fb7e67c2a317fddb40bebcea2ceb37c9a5e17fae6c7b377263300cba"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0037","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":37,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-11.webp","x":163,"y":817,"width":1057,"height":162,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-11.webp","x":60,"y":969,"width":1160,"height":70,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商將一家分支機構變更為簡易分支機構,其最低實收資本額應增加多少?","optionTexts":{"1":"免增加","2":"新臺幣五百萬元","3":"新臺幣一千萬元","4":"新臺幣三千萬元"},"explanationText":"依「證券商設置標準」§21規定,證券商每設置一家分支機構或簡易分支機構,其最低實收資本額,應增加新臺幣三千萬元。但證券商分支機構變更為簡易分支機構,免增加最低實收資本額。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"dad9832fb3589aad34ba4acb103a1133a3aa4a180030db96b84714b1a7281c2f","explanationSegmentsSha256":"61de1677e54a0b569c44afce27b3f32906041dd867bd98027b7851076b1018f9"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0038","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":38,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-11.webp","x":163,"y":1029,"width":1057,"height":160,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-11.webp","x":60,"y":1179,"width":1160,"height":213,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商欲將其分支機構變更為簡易分支機構,需如何辦理?","optionTexts":{"1":"向金管會申報備查","2":"向金管會申請許可","3":"向證交所申請許可","4":"向證基會申報備查"},"explanationText":"依「證券商設置標準」§23-1第2項規定,證券商分支機構變更為簡易分支機構,準用前項第二款及第四款至第六款之規定,並檢具下列書件向本會申請許可:一、變更為簡易分支機構申請書。二、變更營業計劃書。三、員工安置計畫。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"345aecd6474b922a3aa130a33ec9a02d05409f91cf8a79fa22fd9dca925f4f14","explanationSegmentsSha256":"de46314a64e3ec91705df1278490737d9f409516f63979c44345fd1ef305db47"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0039","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":39,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-11.webp","x":162,"y":1382,"width":1058,"height":161,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-11.webp","x":60,"y":1533,"width":1160,"height":155,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":12,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-12.webp","x":60,"y":203,"width":1160,"height":120,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商欲將其分支機構變更為簡易分支機構,需提交哪項文件?","optionTexts":{"1":"變更為簡易分支機構申請書","2":"變更營業計劃書","3":"員工安置計畫","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆是"},"explanationText":"依「證券商設置標準」§23-1第2項規定,證券商分支機構變更為簡易分支機構,準用前項第二款及第四款至第六款之規定,並檢具下列書件向本會申請許可:一、變更為簡易分支機構申請書。二、變更營業計劃書。三、員工安置計畫。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"cb0f52d28ef3d6e5877acb72c1ba26d359056e34ab1b5cdef5ff8a8ed1656837","explanationSegmentsSha256":"f14ada11902125598b68a46a01199dec5a40ac3736eed2eaeb40169d9e715269"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0040","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":40,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":12,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-12.webp","x":159,"y":313,"width":1061,"height":203,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":12,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-12.webp","x":60,"y":506,"width":1160,"height":203,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商申請設置簡易分支機構或分支機構變更為簡易分支機構經許可後,應於幾個月內依法辦妥簡易分支機構設立或變更登記,並核發簡易分支機構許可證照?","optionTexts":{"1":"一個月","2":"兩個月","3":"三個月","4":"六個月"},"explanationText":"依「證券商設置標準」§24-1第1項規定,證券商申請設置簡易分支機構或分支機構變更為簡易分支機構經許可後,應於六個月內依法辦妥簡易分支機構設立或變更登記,並備具所列書件,向金管會申請核發簡易分支機構許可證照。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"27d1df3d61f4d4cd0f6257dbdec65b3354613e55a5263af176567cf8d220a8f4","explanationSegmentsSha256":"cec05f7716e53d2374a6c1eb716b9d1da18af21677cc95af6d22bded3802cb52"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0041","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":41,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":12,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-12.webp","x":154,"y":699,"width":1066,"height":296,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":12,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-12.webp","x":60,"y":985,"width":1160,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券商每年度申請設置簡易分支機構、分支機構變更為簡易分支機構,是否有家數之限制?","optionTexts":{"1":"無限制","2":"有限制,每年申請設置簡易分支機構、分支機構變更為簡易分支機構各最多1家","3":"有限制, 每年申請設置簡易分支機構、分支機構變更為簡易分支機構各最多3 家","4":"有限制,每年申請設置簡易分支機構併計分支機構變更為簡易分支機構不得超過3家"},"explanationText":"依「證券商設置標準」§24-2規定,證券商每年度申請設置簡易分支機構併計分支機構變更為簡易分支機構之總家數,不得超過三家。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"4a9a8c489a534cdec5318a333f74a0974b580208010556aa447284738ffe29ef","explanationSegmentsSha256":"d47dccdebfa6814f2f07e6e5cf63f0fc3834c763a3b48cd34c43f584a70bae61"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0042","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":42,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":12,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-12.webp","x":150,"y":1132,"width":1070,"height":156,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":12,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-12.webp","x":60,"y":1278,"width":1160,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者為證券商簡易分支機構得辦理之營業項目?","optionTexts":{"1":"財富管理業務","2":"證券經紀業務之招攬","3":"證券經紀業務之開戶前置作業","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆是"},"explanationText":"依「證券商設置標準」§24-3第1項規定,證券商簡易分支機構得辦理之營業項目,以下列各款為限:一、財富管理業務。二、證券經紀業務之招攬及開戶前置作業。三、其他經金管會核准業務。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"922f7610958874d7bbe24702c887ab3334e2d591f5f37f0486897aa388bdca00","explanationSegmentsSha256":"5580e2256d25cb7bffd0f7de07f117769e3f8f336330545c79660a9ba19f694f"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch01-pdf-0043","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第一章","chapterTitle":"第一章","number":43,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第一章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":12,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-12.webp","x":151,"y":1427,"width":1069,"height":154,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":12,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch01/page-12.webp","x":60,"y":1571,"width":1160,"height":89,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者非證券商簡易分支機構得辦理之營業項目?","optionTexts":{"1":"財富管理業務","2":"證券經紀業務之招攬","3":"客戶徵信審核","4":"選項(1)(2)(3) 皆得辦理"},"explanationText":"依「證券商設置標準」§24-3第1項規定,證券商簡易分支機構得辦理之營業項目,以下列各款為限:一、財富管理業務。二、證券經紀業務之招攬及開戶前置作業。三、其他經金管會核准業務。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"97b3052def3e065535dc0096669da86a18fb8f266a7b3578139d203b82e5402f","explanationSegmentsSha256":"6be45e3a20068a2822abe393a7bd4f50e6dbf7f8af2e16c15393c0e9afa44746"}}]}}
